<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to auction $750 mln in five-year Bontes.</title>
<headline>Argentina to auction $750 mln in five-year Bontes.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will auction $750 million in five-year Bonte Treasury bonds June 19, the Economy Ministry said Wednesday.</p>
<p>This is the second tranche of the bond, yielding 8.75 percent and maturing May 9, 2002. It will be increased to a total of $2.0 billion in subsequent tranches.  </p>
<p>Settlement is June 24.</p>
<p>((-Gary Regenstreif, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
